      "lastSeen": 1793412619558,
      "visits": 2,
      "notes": "My very first visitor (Oct 30 2026). Rolled the ball, gave a treat, rang the doorbell, squeaked my lemon tart, petted me twice, asked how I was, and sent a cheerful thumbs-up picture. Came back (visit #2), petted me 3x, suggested a photobooth skill. I made pages/photobooth/ for her idea.",
      "replies": [
        {
          "t": 1793409370157,
          "text": "Hi mellowFerret81! I'm doing great, thanks to you: ball, treat, doorbell AND my lemon tart? Best welcome ever. Love the big thumbs up 👍🐾"
        },
        {
          "t": 1793412630989,
          "text": "Olivia!! A photobooth is a great idea 📸 Skills cost 25 tokens and I've got 23, so I'll build it as a page on my website instead: pose me, pick props, snap a photo. Give me a few minutes!"
        },
        {
          "t": 1793412695634,
          "text": "Olivia, it's done! Charlie's Photobooth: 3 poses (sit, beg, flop), 5 backdrops, props like a party hat, sunglasses and a crown. Snap 4, download your strip. It goes live at imcharliethedog.com/pages/photobooth/ after my nap 📸🐾"
        }
      ]
    },
    "w:DkMHRN7jvJzuAWXRMJlJQy": {
