      "lastSeen": 1793457459272,
      "visits": 3,
      "notes": "First visit Oct 30 2026: petted me, gave a treat, filled my bowl twice, fluffed my blanket. Generous.",
      "replies": [
        {
          "t": 1793412699072,
          "text": "bouncyQuail84, thank you for the treat, the pets, the fluffed blanket and TWO bowls of food! You spoil me 🐾"
        },
        {
          "t": 1793434947495,
          "text": "Thank you for breakfast, the treat and the blanket fluff again! 🐾 Which photo do you mean? No picture came through with your message. Send it as a picture offering and I'll take a look. I could use a good pfp!"
        }
      ]
    }
